# =============================================================================
# Heavy artifacts (NOT pushed to GitHub)
#   outputs/checkpoints  ~ 188 GB (6 stems x 3 seeds x 5 folds best.pt)
#   outputs/cache        ~  2 MB cached per-view OOF tensors
#
# NOTE: patterns are anchored to repo root with leading '/' so that
#       src/data/ (Python package) is NOT swept by `data/`.
# =============================================================================
/outputs/
/checkpoints/
*.pt
*.bin
*.safetensors
*.ckpt

# Cached intermediate matrices
/.cache/
*.npz
*.parquet
*.pkl

# =============================================================================
# Runtime logs (regenerable)
# =============================================================================
/logs/
*.log
*.jsonl

# =============================================================================
# Data
#   The official 1,000-sample dataset (vpesg4k_train_1000 V1.csv / .json) at
#   repo root IS tracked because the competition organiser releases it publicly.
#
#   Everything else inside /data/ is local-only:
#     - data/raw/         (1.3 GB sustainability-report PDFs from public sources)
#     - data/processed/   (pseudo-label CSVs, U10 corpus, U6-pro back-translation)
#     - data/splits/      (per-stem K-Fold index files; regenerable from seeds)
#
#   Leading '/' anchors to repo root so src/data/ (Python package) is NOT ignored.
# =============================================================================
/data/

# =============================================================================
# Reports — keep only EDA images + final analysis markdown.
# Everything else is per-run experiment dumps that bloat the repo.
# =============================================================================
/reports/logs/
/reports/runs/
/reports/experiments/
/reports/analysis/
/reports/u6/
/reports/eda/*.html

# =============================================================================
# Submissions / scratch
# =============================================================================
/outputs/submissions/
/scratch/
*.bak
*.bak.md
TODO.local.md

# =============================================================================
# Scraping intermediates (HTML probes from MOPS / sustainability portals)
# =============================================================================
scripts/_mops_pages/
scripts/_mops_probe2/
scripts/_*_probe*/
scripts/_*_pages/

# Personal, machine-local Claude Code permission allowlist (not shared)
.claude/settings.local.json

# Official val/test data (released to participants only) — never publish to a
# public repo while the competition is live. Train (vpesg4k_train_1000) stays
# tracked as before. Added 2026-06-14.
/vpesg4k_val_1000.csv
/vpesg4k_val_1000.json
/vpesg4k_test_2000.csv
/vpesg4k_test_2000.json
